    "title": "Pack Wrestling to Host Technique Camp June 16-18 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Via Colorado State University Pueblo, ,\n1 days ago PUEBLO, Colo. (April 21, 2026) - Colorado State University Pueblo wrestling Head Coach Dax Charles and the ThunderWolves have announced a three-day Technique Camp that is set to take place on June 16-18 inside the CSU Pueblo Wrestling Room. The technique camp is for athletes ages 10-18 years old and will be held in three sessions starting at 9:30 a.m. each day. Cost is $275 for overnight campers which includes Room & Board and for commuter campers, the cost is $125. A team camp is also available by contacting Coach Charles. To register, visit packwrestling.totalcamps.com and for more information, contact... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
